# integration.rts_api_play: the pause key, the Esc menu's Resume and Quit, through SDL's queue.
0   move 640 360
# P pauses and P goes on: a second the session holds while frames still run.
10  key p down
11  key p up
70  key p down
71  key p up
# Esc opens the menu, which holds the session too; its Resume button lets it go on.
100 key escape down
101 key escape up
110 aim ui resume
112 press left
114 release left
# Esc again, and the menu's Quit ends the session: the game asks, the host stops.
150 key escape down
151 key escape up
160 aim ui quit-menu
162 press left
164 release left
